Included: All full-time and regular part-time production and maintenance employees working in the following job classifications: Shipping Specialist; Driver & Route Rep; Distribution Specialist; Bike Courier & Route Rep; Senior Production Associate; Production Roaster; Maintenance Specialist; Prod Asst L1; Inventory Specialist; Green Specialist; Production Technician; and Coffee Ambassador;

