Others permitted to vote: The parties have agreed that “Ship Lead” and individuals currently employed as “Production Assistant, Temporary” and “Production Associate, Temporary” may vote in the election but their ballots will be challenged since their eligibility has not been resolved.  No decision has been made regarding whether the individuals in these classifications or groups are included in, or excluded from, the bargaining unit.  The eligibility or inclusion of these individuals will be resolved, if necessary, following the election.

